    "production_notes": "Euphoric trap beat with warm sliding 808s, bright plucky synths and airy pads, Fast hi-hat rolls and crisp snares, Atmospheric risers into explosive drops, Chopped vocal samples for energy, Hooks full and anthemic; verses slightly stripped back for bounce, Occasional beat pauses for punchline delivery,",
